WEBVTT

00:00:04.279 --> 00:00:07.456
The Robotniks
have entered the chat.

00:00:08.457 --> 00:00:09.632
Wait.

00:00:09.806 --> 00:00:10.981
Poppyseed?

00:00:12.635 --> 00:00:14.115
Grand-geezer?

00:00:14.289 --> 00:00:15.725
<i>¿Dónde está?</i>

00:00:15.899 --> 00:00:17.640
I'm right here.

00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:19.381
If you weren't family,

00:00:19.555 --> 00:00:21.383
I could have gut you
like a pheasant.

00:00:21.557 --> 00:00:24.560
I mean, try to keep up.

00:00:27.998 --> 00:00:31.350
[narrator] <i>And now back to
"La UÚltima Pasión."</i>

00:00:31.524 --> 00:00:32.916
<i>UÚltima Pasión...</i>

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.919
can only belong to one.

00:00:36.093 --> 00:00:37.138
No.

00:00:38.139 --> 00:00:41.577
It can only belong...
to Juan!

00:00:41.751 --> 00:00:44.145
Gabriella should kill them both.

00:00:44.319 --> 00:00:46.800
She's not a prize to be won.

00:00:46.974 --> 00:00:49.063
"Kill this. Murder that."

00:00:49.237 --> 00:00:52.632
You need to lighten up, Shadow.
We're about to rule the world.

00:00:52.806 --> 00:00:54.938
When we're done...

00:00:55.112 --> 00:00:57.854
there won't be
anything left to rule.

00:00:58.028 --> 00:01:00.640
That is dark. Even for you.

00:01:01.597 --> 00:01:03.164
What are you
and the professor up to?

00:01:03.338 --> 00:01:05.209
Hello! What's this?

00:01:05.384 --> 00:01:07.951
I knew I saw
an outside signal!

00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:09.997
<i>Cheerio!</i>

00:01:10.171 --> 00:01:12.129
<i>I guess someone
forgot to flush.</i>

00:01:18.353 --> 00:01:19.615
[gasps]

00:01:23.097 --> 00:01:25.708
[Stone screaming]

00:01:25.882 --> 00:01:28.537
[both panting]

00:01:33.107 --> 00:01:35.979
What now, my cunning cohort?

00:01:36.153 --> 00:01:37.677
Just a little teamwork!

00:01:37.851 --> 00:01:40.680
[yelping]

00:01:42.421 --> 00:01:43.944
[wheezing gasp]

00:01:45.598 --> 00:01:46.773
Hey...

00:01:47.426 --> 00:01:48.818
The lasers...

00:01:49.906 --> 00:01:52.518
don't seem to be
penetrating my suit.

00:01:53.867 --> 00:01:56.913
They're conforming
to the shape
of my bodacious bod.

00:01:57.087 --> 00:01:58.524
Of course.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.354
I designed these suits
to create a field

00:02:02.528 --> 00:02:04.617
of laser-bending
thermal distortion.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.706
Wasn't sure it would work
till now.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:08.316
You're heartless, son.

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.362
- Hmm!
- Rotten to the core.

00:02:10.536 --> 00:02:12.233
- Mm-hmm.
- I'm...

00:02:12.407 --> 00:02:13.626
so proud.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:16.150
So now we can just dance
right through.

00:02:18.761 --> 00:02:20.850
That sounds like a challenge.

00:02:21.982 --> 00:02:23.026
[convulsive gag]

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.857
["Galvanize"
by the Chemical Brothers
playing]

00:03:06.548 --> 00:03:09.464
[mouthing along]
<i>♪ My finger is on the button ♪</i>

00:03:09.638 --> 00:03:10.813
<i>♪ Push the button ♪</i>

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.658
The Robotniks are almost
at the vault!

00:03:29.832 --> 00:03:31.921
We're out of time. I'm going.

00:03:32.095 --> 00:03:33.227
No, Sonic!

00:03:33.401 --> 00:03:34.576
I haven't disabled
the traps yet!

00:03:36.665 --> 00:03:38.232
Too late!

00:03:38.406 --> 00:03:41.365
Look at me! I'm running
on the wrong side of the road!

00:03:44.543 --> 00:03:46.196
Well, I got to take in
the sights.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.416
Paul, John, George,
the other one!

00:03:48.590 --> 00:03:50.287
Loud American coming through!

00:03:50.462 --> 00:03:51.898
Excuse me. Pardon me.

00:03:52.072 --> 00:03:53.508
'Ello, guv'nor!
Which way to Hogwarts?

00:03:53.682 --> 00:03:55.118
Hear ye, hear ye!

00:03:55.292 --> 00:03:57.469
Sonic the Hedgehog
wants a cuppa tea!

00:03:57.643 --> 00:03:59.296
Hold this for me, please.

00:04:00.559 --> 00:04:01.908
You're not gonna make it!

00:04:02.082 --> 00:04:03.083
I can make it.

00:04:06.608 --> 00:04:08.001
You're not gonna make it!

00:04:08.175 --> 00:04:09.350
[Sonic] I'm gonna make it.

00:04:11.091 --> 00:04:12.266
I'm not gonna make it.

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.877
I'm not gonna make it!

00:04:16.052 --> 00:04:17.140
[Tails yells]

00:04:19.491 --> 00:04:21.318
- Made it!
- Whoo!

00:04:23.016 --> 00:04:25.018
Excuse me. Coming through.
No time for autographs.

00:04:25.192 --> 00:04:26.236
Got to go, bye!

00:04:33.505 --> 00:04:36.116
Our destiny awaits.

00:04:37.204 --> 00:04:39.032
Stop right there, Roboscum!

00:04:39.206 --> 00:04:41.425
- Let's do this!
- Copy!

00:04:44.385 --> 00:04:45.821
[electronic throbbing]

00:04:45.995 --> 00:04:47.823
[both grunting loudly]

00:04:48.737 --> 00:04:50.304
Too slow, Eggmen.

00:04:50.478 --> 00:04:53.742
Now if you don't mind,
I've got to get that key.

00:04:53.916 --> 00:04:55.265
Whoa!

00:04:55.439 --> 00:04:57.441
My feet. Why can't I
use my beautiful feet?

00:04:57.616 --> 00:04:59.095
Heh-heh![Rockwell] Because...

00:04:59.269 --> 00:05:02.316
this vault is armed
with variable gravity.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:03.709
[straining]

00:05:03.883 --> 00:05:04.710
No kidding.

00:05:04.884 --> 00:05:06.668
[Rockwell] Green goes up...

00:05:06.842 --> 00:05:09.018
and red takes you down... hard.

00:05:09.192 --> 00:05:10.367
Rockwell, listen to me.

00:05:10.542 --> 00:05:12.326
The Robotniks are planning to--
[yelps]

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.415
Oh, they're planning on stealing
a second key, just like you are?

00:05:14.589 --> 00:05:15.982
Yes, I'm aware.

00:05:17.505 --> 00:05:20.029
I called it
the second Commander Walters
was attacked.

00:05:20.203 --> 00:05:21.683
So...

00:05:21.857 --> 00:05:24.425
thank you
for taking the bait

00:05:24.599 --> 00:05:26.079
and falling
right into my trap.

00:05:26.253 --> 00:05:28.385
I don't believe this.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.170
[Gerald]
I know, grandson.

00:05:30.344 --> 00:05:32.346
A woman in the military!

00:05:34.261 --> 00:05:35.697
Let's go.

00:05:36.785 --> 00:05:38.004
Go, positions!

00:05:38.178 --> 00:05:39.266
Full perimeter.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.659
[weapons powering up]

00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:42.138
Robotnik.

00:05:42.312 --> 00:05:44.576
Going full spandex, huh?
Who's the fossil?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:48.884
That's my grandfather,
you dough-eating dimbecile.

00:05:49.058 --> 00:05:52.148
- Who are they?
- A couple of bleeding hearts,

00:05:52.322 --> 00:05:55.151
here to rescue
their emotional-support animals.

00:05:55.325 --> 00:05:57.110
Enough! It's over.

00:05:57.284 --> 00:06:00.853
The only way
you're leaving here
is in handcuffs.

00:06:01.027 --> 00:06:02.724
There is no other way out.

00:06:02.898 --> 00:06:05.684
You know, there might be
one other way out.

00:06:05.858 --> 00:06:07.250
And what is that
supposed to mean?

00:06:07.424 --> 00:06:09.339
[Sonic] Hey, big guy,
I think it's time to...

00:06:10.514 --> 00:06:13.822
Break glass
in case of emergency!

00:06:15.781 --> 00:06:17.826
[roaring]

00:06:18.697 --> 00:06:19.959
[grunts]

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.006
Ha! Nothing can stop
Team Knuckles!

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:25.268
Open fire!

00:06:26.269 --> 00:06:28.141
[yelps] Knuckles,
turn this stuff off!

00:06:28.315 --> 00:06:29.621
- Hurry!
- On it.

00:06:31.231 --> 00:06:32.319
Uh-oh.

00:06:32.493 --> 00:06:34.451
[all yelling in surprise]

00:06:34.626 --> 00:06:36.628
[grunting]

00:06:39.935 --> 00:06:42.285
Ha! See how you like it--
[groans]

00:06:42.459 --> 00:06:44.461
[yelping]

00:06:46.028 --> 00:06:47.813
[both gasp]

00:06:47.987 --> 00:06:49.641
[all groaning]

00:06:49.815 --> 00:06:51.860
- Can you move?
- No, not at all.

00:06:52.034 --> 00:06:54.471
- Tails, can you?
- No, I'm stuck.

00:06:54.646 --> 00:06:56.038
We might be here a while.

00:06:56.212 --> 00:06:58.214
[growls, grunts]

00:06:58.388 --> 00:07:00.652
Whoa! Whoa. Whoa. Whoa.

00:07:01.653 --> 00:07:03.089
Where's the key?

00:07:09.008 --> 00:07:10.226
Whoa!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:13.055
- What was that?
- We might have a problem.

00:07:14.709 --> 00:07:16.668
[grunts] No, no, no, no!

00:07:17.843 --> 00:07:20.323
[grunting]

00:07:24.327 --> 00:07:25.938
[exclaims]

00:07:26.852 --> 00:07:27.940
[huffs]

